{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "I have been to a few hackathons and startup weekends over the last few years and I have a pretty good prize rate (I have placed at more than 50% of the events).", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f10c26fd6ad3fab30309e85068f9a4538706669e26ca9e9ee7191ae9bfdf083b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.54], [3, 0.54, 0.82], [4, 0.82, 0.96], [5, 0.96, 1.14], [6, 1.14, 1.82], [7, 1.82, 2.02], [9, 2.4, 2.66], [10, 2.66, 2.98], [11, 2.98, 3.12], [12, 3.12, 3.34], [13, 3.34, 3.56], [14, 3.56, 3.94], [15, 4.3, 4.36], [16, 4.36, 4.46], [17, 4.46, 4.56], [18, 4.56, 4.68], [19, 4.68, 4.88], [20, 4.88, 5.1], [21, 5.1, 5.44], [22, 5.44, 5.66], [23, 6.06, 6.22], [24, 6.22, 6.34], [25, 6.34, 6.58], [27, 6.78, 6.94], [28, 6.94, 7.06], [29, 7.06, 7.4], [30, 7.7, 7.88], [31, 7.88, 8.0], [32, 8.0, 8.34]]}, {"text": "After my back to back win of the ATT and FinApps hackathons, I want to share my thoughts on what it takes to be a winning team.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/81b2c85d51f29196382377266209957263cca1eb8612105fee5be23c3946bdbe.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.38], [1, 0.38, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.8], [3, 0.8, 0.9], [4, 0.9, 1.0], [5, 1.0, 1.26], [6, 1.26, 1.44], [7, 1.44, 1.54], [11, 2.72, 3.22], [12, 3.72, 3.8], [13, 3.8, 3.96], [14, 3.96, 4.1], [15, 4.1, 4.28], [16, 4.28, 4.46], [17, 4.46, 4.7], [18, 4.7, 5.0], [19, 5.0, 5.14], [20, 5.14, 5.26], [21, 5.26, 5.52], [22, 5.52, 5.86], [23, 5.86, 6.0], [24, 6.0, 6.1], [25, 6.1, 6.3], [26, 6.3, 6.66]]}, {"text": "The best prize is the easiest", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f76daa9f1d5b84161f4381a6e256d0a427aeea16493b5e6eb8e17b24f3b0b095.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.82], [3, 0.82, 1.1], [4, 1.1, 1.22], [5, 1.22, 1.64]]}, {"text": "Your first goal of each event though should be building out your network.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d011dc6381fec6f1c85d4c1905d862723f0d9e673d4fe61540ae698829927b36.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 0.86], [4, 0.86, 1.02], [5, 1.02, 1.28], [7, 1.54, 1.92], [8, 1.92, 2.08], [9, 2.08, 2.4], [10, 2.4, 2.62], [11, 2.62, 2.78], [12, 2.78, 3.1]]}, {"text": "I have met some very interesting individuals (a VC, and awesome developers and designers, etc.)", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/bd8bfb8ed6c0bf5258220cc43a7616c239fead4a8af3e350fe5d5b593285571e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.26], [2, 0.26, 0.4], [3, 0.4, 0.64], [4, 0.64, 0.9], [5, 0.9, 1.4], [6, 1.4, 2.1], [8, 2.6, 2.94], [9, 3.54, 3.56], [10, 3.56, 3.88], [11, 3.88, 4.4], [12, 4.4, 4.66], [13, 4.66, 5.06], [14, 5.06, 5.5]]}, {"text": "by attending these events.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ee0493c8a3e948eb032429540b23c7fe22256a5254ff185286d460a6f00c0e93.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.6], [2, 0.6, 0.9], [3, 0.9, 1.2]]}, {"text": "Meeting other smart and talented like-minded people is infinitely more valuable (and easier to obtain) than any monetary prize.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c8ba7dc600de3d578a66f792b8eb24009ff692d9f1c45c8d4a9bb2ec28515d8e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.62], [2, 0.62, 0.94], [3, 0.94, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.5], [6, 2.0, 2.38], [7, 2.38, 2.7], [8, 2.7, 3.24], [9, 3.24, 3.56], [10, 3.56, 4.04], [11, 4.04, 4.46], [12, 4.46, 4.76], [13, 4.76, 4.96], [14, 4.96, 5.3], [15, 5.3, 5.72], [16, 5.72, 6.12], [17, 6.12, 6.48], [18, 6.48, 7.06]]}, {"text": "I try to avoid grouping with people that I already know, because I want to find people I will work with again in the future.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/4bde6a94a5a4b7c21eed3620d64605a866221f4151b515a26d63165268f79d21.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.54], [3, 0.54, 0.82], [4, 0.82, 1.16], [5, 1.16, 1.48], [6, 1.48, 1.74], [7, 1.74, 1.9], [8, 1.9, 2.02], [9, 2.02, 2.38], [10, 2.38, 2.78], [11, 3.1, 3.3], [12, 3.3, 3.42], [13, 3.42, 3.62], [14, 3.62, 3.78], [15, 3.78, 3.96], [16, 3.96, 4.34], [17, 4.34, 4.5], [18, 4.5, 4.62], [19, 4.62, 4.8], [20, 4.8, 4.98], [21, 4.98, 5.22], [22, 5.22, 5.38], [23, 5.38, 5.5], [24, 5.5, 5.84]]}, {"text": "My friends are known variables.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/9b85ff3d96f4d052dc93aecd99de928cc43c72eb3ab7364d7c4cbea1a3e9c9f8.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 0.8], [4, 0.8, 1.22]]}, {"text": "While awesome, I want to see who else is awesome to work with.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c9e8573cf39097578deb36f334a6db089e245e54722360f2ec7aa43a85c1dbb9.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.64], [2, 1.16, 1.26], [3, 1.26, 1.4], [4, 1.4, 1.56], [5, 1.56, 1.72], [6, 1.72, 1.94], [7, 1.94, 2.18], [8, 2.18, 2.38], [9, 2.38, 2.68], [10, 2.68, 2.88], [11, 2.88, 3.04], [12, 3.04, 3.46]]}, {"text": "Winning the competition", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c80fd8b1d5d65672310aca67fb2c785d77e5b236effdf7e0beffb522681a0bef.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.9]]}, {"text": "The Team", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1aaf13d5075cfb21394f724da0f165350688bf4590637edc483c7ed2a5157894.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.22, 0.58]]}, {"text": "First and foremost, as with starting a company, building a software product, or pretty much any other group activity, you need to have a solid team.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/39d08c37aea934c9e8bae87eeeea737db591c7aa42cc46891ba085d3f870fc51.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 0.92], [3, 1.26, 1.38], [4, 1.38, 1.5], [5, 1.5, 1.78], [7, 1.94, 2.32], [8, 2.72, 2.9], [9, 2.9, 3.08], [10, 3.08, 3.36], [11, 3.36, 3.88], [13, 4.26, 4.52], [14, 4.52, 4.78], [15, 4.78, 5.04], [16, 5.04, 5.38], [17, 5.38, 5.58], [18, 5.58, 6.08], [19, 6.58, 6.8], [20, 6.8, 6.94], [21, 6.94, 7.08], [22, 7.08, 7.24], [23, 7.24, 7.4], [24, 7.4, 7.66], [25, 7.66, 8.02]]}, {"text": "There are two types of people on a good Hackathon team: The Coder and The Presenter.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/202a7a4ce4f1dcda22d6fe8a33c44340d97a974e7849965a08609f07bc339c0f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.44], [3, 0.44, 0.7], [4, 0.7, 0.88], [5, 0.88, 1.16], [6, 1.16, 1.44], [7, 1.44, 1.56], [8, 1.56, 1.72], [9, 1.72, 2.16], [10, 2.16, 2.6], [11, 2.96, 3.06], [13, 3.34, 3.6], [14, 3.6, 3.72], [15, 3.72, 4.16]]}, {"text": "The coders have the easiest job.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c88c98840bfdf7ad726b4a34e08d921ed2350091954bdf7d9d96a0fb60297cee.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.12], [1, 0.12, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 1.06], [4, 1.06, 1.42], [5, 1.42, 1.76]]}, {"text": "They have to develop a working prototype in 18 hours.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/baf1b814bb8f297fda338f14a103f129aa4389b4f63d021f2222fe143a6ed57e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.46], [3, 0.46, 0.74], [4, 0.74, 0.92], [5, 0.92, 1.2], [6, 1.2, 1.68], [7, 1.68, 1.94], [8, 1.94, 2.24], [9, 2.24, 2.58]]}, {"text": "Good coders can work independently and solve problems they run into quickly.", "block": 8, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ede6bed0a959a1994608359d01522b8cfe57428cd361821714ca5ed6f3f81ce2.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.6], [2, 0.6, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 0.9], [4, 0.9, 1.44], [5, 1.44, 1.8], [6, 1.8, 2.02], [7, 2.02, 2.44], [8, 2.44, 2.66], [9, 2.66, 2.8], [10, 2.8, 3.0], [11, 3.0, 3.34]]}, {"text": "Coders have to deliver.", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/9f75956e669a268db4ba8474faa7797bf3d25dcce9a6f41b5904baa8328e66e0.mp3"}, {"text": "It is more important to have a simple 100% finished product than an advanced 80% finished product.", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/79a47d8043807fd859347f4f868e065b912b3aee3eb76ad5ccd34a58702ac408.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.56], [3, 0.56, 0.98], [4, 0.98, 1.16], [5, 1.16, 1.36], [6, 1.36, 1.56], [7, 1.56, 1.92], [8, 1.92, 2.44], [9, 2.86, 3.24], [10, 3.24, 3.7], [11, 3.7, 3.98], [12, 3.98, 4.12], [13, 4.12, 4.38], [14, 4.38, 4.86], [15, 5.22, 5.58], [16, 5.58, 6.04]]}, {"text": "During the presentation, don’t make the judges put on their imagination hats and tell them what you could of done if you insert lame excuse here.", "block": 9, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d9e31061d309157e739b56db68587a50c5df02b1040a3f1bb8531bd66ac80a64.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 1.04], [3, 1.5, 1.68], [4, 1.68, 1.8], [5, 1.8, 1.98], [6, 1.98, 2.26], [7, 2.26, 2.54], [8, 2.54, 2.72], [9, 2.72, 2.86], [10, 2.86, 3.26], [11, 3.26, 3.76], [12, 3.76, 4.04], [13, 4.04, 4.22], [14, 4.22, 4.44], [15, 4.44, 4.54], [16, 4.54, 4.66], [17, 4.66, 4.88], [19, 5.06, 5.34], [20, 5.34, 5.72], [21, 5.72, 5.86], [22, 5.86, 6.22], [23, 6.22, 6.46], [24, 6.46, 6.84], [25, 6.84, 7.2]]}, {"text": "You need one presenter and that person needs to be awesome at public speaking.", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/eb125b91a7d12bafc0cb23d81671f02ca09392a6c3ae3895a74669bd570a1810.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.6], [3, 0.6, 1.16], [4, 1.16, 1.48], [5, 1.48, 1.64], [6, 1.64, 1.96], [7, 1.96, 2.16], [8, 2.16, 2.36], [9, 2.36, 2.46], [10, 2.46, 2.82], [11, 2.82, 3.0], [12, 3.0, 3.24], [13, 3.24, 3.7]]}, {"text": "Typically they will also provide product development guidance.", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3e26b63a719b2d0ce47f157614027bde685a34590f67a9ae01b899640ff49205.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.46], [1, 0.58, 0.7], [2, 0.7, 0.86], [3, 0.86, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.46], [5, 1.46, 1.84], [6, 1.84, 2.36], [7, 2.36, 2.76]]}, {"text": "The good presenter is just as valuable as a good coder, if not more.", "block": 10, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7bf0f9d4a73209487641f9cf179d5713f5fb03bf7a18b7498c672ca92582455e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.86], [3, 0.86, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.42], [5, 1.42, 1.68], [6, 1.68, 2.08], [7, 2.08, 2.38], [8, 2.38, 2.48], [9, 2.48, 2.62], [10, 2.62, 3.08], [11, 3.3, 3.44], [12, 3.44, 3.6], [13, 3.6, 3.86]]}, {"text": "I have seen judges destroy teams without solid presenters during questioning.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b2205c3bd015671d1d90015ed04d2a956bcc7f9d175444177d590566cebe9779.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.26], [2, 0.26, 0.46], [3, 0.46, 0.74], [4, 0.74, 1.18], [5, 1.18, 1.58], [6, 1.58, 1.86], [7, 1.86, 2.18], [8, 2.18, 2.64], [9, 2.64, 2.92], [10, 2.92, 3.4]]}, {"text": "Some judges will ask some really hard questions and you have to have someone be able to deliver awesome answers on the fly.", "block": 11, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/84b3a7cc16bedf3012b552787f43e2031fdc559b46dc7cd670bfb2309a9ea08b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 0.92], [4, 0.92, 1.12], [5, 1.12, 1.4], [6, 1.4, 1.6], [7, 1.6, 2.1], [8, 2.58, 2.82], [9, 2.82, 2.98], [10, 2.98, 3.18], [11, 3.18, 3.42], [12, 3.42, 3.6], [13, 3.6, 4.02], [14, 4.02, 4.24], [15, 4.24, 4.46], [16, 4.46, 4.62], [17, 4.62, 4.92], [18, 4.92, 5.36], [19, 5.36, 5.68], [20, 5.68, 5.9], [21, 5.9, 6.02], [22, 6.02, 6.24]]}, {"text": "An example of this was at the FinApps hackathon, a judge asked us how we secured our application.", "block": 12, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ba85c5afbd5f566fac25db1f150073b0f401bdf1beac80041dcf59ddaf0a639c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.68], [2, 0.68, 0.88], [3, 0.88, 1.06], [4, 1.06, 1.3], [5, 1.3, 1.48], [6, 1.48, 1.64], [8, 2.1, 2.56], [9, 3.04, 3.12], [10, 3.12, 3.24], [11, 3.24, 3.66], [12, 3.66, 3.84], [13, 3.84, 4.04], [14, 4.04, 4.2], [15, 4.2, 4.62], [16, 4.62, 4.8], [17, 4.8, 5.34]]}, {"text": "Rather than saying, “oh, uhh… that is a good point.", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e3516e2e506a9f553b94cb1093deac15ef917b3cd9bae796b4618e297cb576c0.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.32], [1, 0.32, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 0.96], [5, 2.32, 2.5], [6, 2.5, 2.7], [7, 2.7, 2.8], [8, 2.8, 2.9], [9, 2.9, 3.22]]}, {"text": "we didn’t think of that”.", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/111f6ee41838625704c32ccc6b4a6b9c851e634b67d2f5943ca318194a6aa189.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.12], [1, 0.12, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.48], [3, 0.48, 0.66], [4, 0.66, 0.9]]}, {"text": "Our presenter said, “Our goal for this hackathon was deliver a functioning credit card selector to accomplish one of the goals laid out by the hackathon.", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3346604ccd349ab8c440a84c59e46c44fd1c95bfad9ec2a6eb35edb1a37302ee.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.56], [2, 0.56, 1.08], [4, 1.54, 1.8], [5, 1.8, 1.98], [6, 1.98, 2.2], [7, 2.2, 2.64], [8, 2.64, 2.96], [9, 2.96, 3.36], [10, 3.36, 3.58], [11, 3.58, 3.96], [12, 3.96, 4.34], [13, 4.34, 4.62], [14, 4.62, 5.12], [15, 5.12, 5.32], [16, 5.32, 5.74], [17, 5.74, 6.02], [18, 6.02, 6.12], [19, 6.12, 6.24], [20, 6.24, 6.58], [21, 6.58, 6.9], [22, 6.9, 7.14], [23, 7.14, 7.32], [24, 7.32, 7.44], [25, 7.44, 7.88]]}, {"text": "We have strategies for adding security into the project, but it was not a target for our team.”", "block": 13, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6e38e29cafb5e63f526522f344782d76339caa2d1ec82548bf30c676776afda2.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.88], [3, 0.88, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.32], [5, 1.32, 1.82], [6, 1.82, 2.1], [7, 2.1, 2.24], [8, 2.24, 2.62], [9, 2.94, 3.06], [10, 3.06, 3.16], [11, 3.16, 3.28], [12, 3.28, 3.42], [13, 3.42, 3.56], [14, 3.56, 3.86], [15, 3.86, 4.1], [16, 4.1, 4.22], [17, 4.22, 4.48]]}, {"text": "The Idea", "block": 14, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3cfac937344da6b540da50e8a816abaf4362ac2e3993345ac839e4fd2ac3f4d0.mp3", "words": [[1, 0.2, 0.54]]}, {"text": "You need to have an idea that is a tiny bit sexy, flexible, and a lot do-able.", "block": 15, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/fc26ac165e8abdca906218ddda4b07b10bca3762ce80e4e9e666a98bba639e18.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.64], [4, 0.64, 0.78], [5, 0.78, 1.1], [6, 1.1, 1.46], [7, 1.46, 1.6], [8, 1.6, 1.7], [9, 1.7, 2.06], [10, 2.06, 2.32], [11, 2.32, 2.84], [12, 3.38, 3.86], [13, 4.28, 4.34], [14, 4.34, 4.42], [15, 4.42, 4.6], [16, 4.6, 4.98]]}, {"text": "You don’t have to bring your own idea, but having one definitely help.", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/323b40458e585678b42214863b04445f51e5e1caca720aebed67b3bdb3df9e57.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.42], [3, 0.42, 0.56], [4, 0.56, 0.7], [5, 0.7, 0.88], [6, 0.88, 1.04], [7, 1.04, 1.44], [8, 1.9, 2.0], [9, 2.0, 2.28], [10, 2.28, 2.5], [11, 2.5, 2.96], [12, 2.96, 3.42]]}, {"text": "I am not very creative and I typically join other teams.", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/0205a4080693938a3f76f8356f273b97729bcd46542b289ae7286dbf84963779.mp3", "words": [[2, 0.28, 0.42], [3, 0.42, 0.68], [4, 0.68, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.4], [6, 1.4, 1.46], [7, 1.46, 1.76], [8, 1.76, 2.12], [9, 2.12, 2.34], [10, 2.34, 2.7]]}, {"text": "My first requirement for a team is not if I like their idea, but if I think they have a solid presenter.", "block": 16, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/5a2a56b761d58ebdb9761efdc3cdc8e57894703aa9d34ef6f19eeda996a4f7e6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.82], [3, 0.82, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.28], [5, 1.28, 1.5], [6, 1.5, 1.72], [7, 1.72, 1.88], [8, 1.88, 2.04], [9, 2.04, 2.14], [10, 2.14, 2.32], [11, 2.32, 2.48], [12, 2.48, 2.84], [13, 3.24, 3.34], [14, 3.34, 3.46], [15, 3.46, 3.56], [16, 3.56, 3.76], [17, 3.76, 3.92], [18, 3.92, 4.04], [19, 4.04, 4.16], [20, 4.16, 4.44], [21, 4.44, 4.96]]}, {"text": "I have seen teams enter the competition with an idea, but end up finding out it was physically impossible to execute that idea.", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/4600433b02d24d13fe54ca92bf0d15d942d49e9bbeceb48969a526f4f979ce75.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.46], [3, 0.46, 0.82], [4, 0.82, 1.06], [5, 1.06, 1.22], [6, 1.22, 1.64], [7, 1.64, 1.9], [8, 1.9, 2.06], [9, 2.06, 2.4], [10, 2.86, 2.92], [11, 2.92, 3.08], [12, 3.08, 3.22], [13, 3.22, 3.48], [14, 3.48, 3.76], [15, 3.76, 3.88], [16, 3.88, 4.02], [17, 4.02, 4.4], [18, 4.4, 5.1], [19, 5.1, 5.38], [20, 5.38, 5.82], [21, 5.82, 6.04], [22, 6.04, 6.38]]}, {"text": "Don’t be married to one concept.", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/874c5d7df6fb66a39bc4e7cd970817d450c64fb52a8cd4b33593ef9ad3a74b9f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [1, 0.34, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.48], [5, 1.48, 2.18]]}, {"text": "13 teams registered for the FinApp’s $30,000 prize and only 7 presented.", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a4fee36b390686bbd977dbabb9fbf5080ea38c3ef77a47aa6392256bf4c8b57c.mp3"}, {"text": "A big issue was that there wasn’t a hardware means of executing their ideas and they ended up going home.", "block": 17, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/ac30cf806c52259bfa824a318f4dec4f428f35506d66bb0635acaec8c947cbcf.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 0.9], [4, 0.9, 1.14], [5, 1.14, 1.56], [6, 1.56, 1.84], [7, 1.84, 1.98], [8, 1.98, 2.26], [9, 2.26, 2.58], [10, 2.58, 2.86], [11, 2.86, 3.32], [12, 3.32, 3.58], [13, 3.58, 3.96], [14, 3.96, 4.3], [15, 4.3, 4.44], [16, 4.44, 4.62], [17, 4.62, 4.78], [18, 4.78, 4.98], [19, 4.98, 5.26]]}, {"text": "Your idea should easily be understood in 5 minutes or less by a panel of non-technical judges.", "block": 18, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/bc994da3b21ad0cd9d9c3a2c097b3f74b95c87ef873efa5c2b427e3e2ea15754.mp3"}, {"text": "Please make sure you have the skillset and the time to execute your idea.", "block": 19, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7aaf1c7dfaa52dad584ac3664387f648eff15615715e553abef0cf68dc03692e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 0.78], [4, 0.78, 0.92], [5, 0.92, 1.14], [7, 1.52, 1.76], [8, 1.76, 1.88], [9, 1.88, 2.14], [10, 2.14, 2.34], [11, 2.34, 2.72], [12, 2.72, 2.92], [13, 2.92, 3.26]]}, {"text": "Many teams end up not being able to accomplish anything during a weekend because they were missing a developer, couldn’t get it to work, or ran out of time.", "block": 19, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/503a5aa41a167980ad842f6d349230b0136aafffd1b653be89aed13efdafb55e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [1, 0.36, 0.62], [2, 0.62, 0.82], [3, 0.82, 0.92], [4, 0.92, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.26], [6, 1.26, 1.52], [7, 1.52, 1.68], [8, 1.68, 2.04], [9, 2.04, 2.52], [10, 2.52, 2.8], [11, 2.8, 2.92], [12, 2.92, 3.24], [13, 3.24, 3.84], [14, 3.84, 4.0], [15, 4.0, 4.08], [16, 4.08, 4.3], [17, 4.3, 4.44], [18, 4.44, 4.88], [19, 5.22, 5.54], [20, 5.54, 5.66], [21, 5.66, 5.76], [22, 5.76, 5.9], [23, 5.9, 6.08], [25, 6.56, 6.72], [26, 6.72, 6.9], [27, 6.9, 7.0], [28, 7.0, 7.24]]}, {"text": "I have seen many teams get up there and say “hey, everyone reach under your seats and pull out that imagination hat that I put under your seat, because I didn’t get anything done this weekend except this 5 min power point presentation.”", "block": 20, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/606f49aea20d21067a920650293aeb2fc64d1420011fded96c5f90a9d61cf046.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.76], [5, 1.16, 1.36], [6, 1.36, 1.5], [7, 1.5, 1.66], [8, 1.66, 1.82], [9, 1.82, 2.04], [11, 3.12, 3.54], [12, 3.54, 3.88], [13, 3.88, 4.12], [14, 4.12, 4.26], [15, 4.26, 4.5], [16, 4.5, 4.8], [17, 4.8, 5.02], [18, 5.02, 5.22], [19, 5.22, 5.4], [20, 5.4, 5.8], [21, 5.8, 6.3], [22, 6.3, 6.54], [23, 6.54, 6.64], [24, 6.64, 6.78], [25, 6.78, 6.98], [26, 6.98, 7.14], [27, 7.14, 7.5], [29, 7.96, 8.14], [30, 8.14, 8.38], [31, 8.38, 8.48], [32, 8.48, 8.82], [33, 8.82, 9.06], [34, 9.06, 9.26], [35, 9.26, 9.56], [36, 9.56, 10.0], [37, 10.0, 10.36], [42, 11.34, 12.06]]}, {"text": "Coder Preparation", "block": 21, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/eddf2009fa0211c1ad8a8151bd711fcf593aa494ade8c3264fbe31fc27c84623.mp3"}, {"text": "Technically you are not allowed to do this before most hackathon events.", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/abc50378a20c3bfa3229243c52c6b66f517fd5a9e5aac55dac066db18372f939.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.44], [1, 0.52, 0.7], [2, 0.7, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 0.9], [4, 0.9, 1.16], [5, 1.16, 1.42], [6, 1.42, 1.56], [7, 1.56, 1.8], [8, 1.8, 2.2], [9, 2.2, 2.6], [10, 2.6, 3.16], [11, 3.16, 3.6]]}, {"text": "Organizers require all work to be at the competition.", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/aee262136fe8f9e74b86194f16f8609a9f38d4892113322c6ad9998204f17ea6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.62], [1, 0.62, 0.96], [2, 0.96, 1.28], [3, 1.28, 1.52], [4, 1.52, 1.74], [5, 1.74, 1.86], [6, 1.86, 1.98], [7, 1.98, 2.06], [8, 2.06, 2.62]]}, {"text": "But I think there are still a few things you can ‘legally’ do to help improve your chances of winning.", "block": 22, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c11582e27809b53631ef8fb9deb9985b0c1fc867564b673a0adc8e98dc5092ff.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.28], [2, 0.28, 0.46], [5, 0.78, 0.96], [6, 0.96, 1.08], [7, 1.08, 1.22], [8, 1.22, 1.54], [9, 1.54, 1.76], [10, 1.76, 2.02], [11, 2.02, 2.56], [12, 2.56, 2.9], [13, 2.9, 3.14], [14, 3.14, 3.3], [15, 3.3, 3.62], [16, 3.62, 3.84], [17, 3.84, 4.14], [18, 4.14, 4.38], [19, 4.38, 4.56]]}, {"text": "If you know you are going to work with a certain technology, set up your environment before hand.", "block": 23, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8e19f78d929f724ff7f5e1ec953794a09d47c993b04b4e1cd79f25c0a673dbc7.mp3"}, {"text": "Don’t go to the hackathon needing to install android studio, ruby on rails, or whatever technology stack you plan on using.", "block": 23, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/10342d339f03c85031c3cf57634bf597210a8626b0f5c2658d80ee0b124b6098.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.54], [3, 0.54, 0.68], [5, 1.1, 1.42], [6, 1.42, 1.62], [7, 1.62, 2.0], [8, 2.0, 2.42], [9, 2.42, 2.92], [10, 3.5, 3.58], [11, 3.58, 3.8], [12, 3.8, 4.02], [13, 4.48, 4.56], [14, 4.56, 4.78], [15, 4.78, 5.32], [16, 5.32, 5.7], [17, 5.7, 5.84], [18, 5.84, 6.02], [19, 6.02, 6.18], [20, 6.18, 6.46]]}, {"text": "As with any installation, there will be headaches that you should solve before the competition.", "block": 23, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e45ad4398cf4f7034e347b1632bb6d32affbaf55cfdc735dcb9ae05728dde146.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.44], [2, 0.44, 0.7], [3, 0.7, 1.34], [4, 1.64, 1.72], [5, 1.72, 1.82], [6, 1.82, 2.0], [7, 2.0, 2.26], [8, 2.26, 2.48], [9, 2.48, 2.6], [10, 2.6, 2.78], [11, 2.78, 3.12], [12, 3.12, 3.44], [13, 3.44, 3.64], [14, 3.64, 4.08]]}, {"text": "If you are working with hardware or an API, make sure your machine can deploy to this hardware before you arrive at the competition.", "block": 24, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f53cfd366741796c49d55652427b9ffdbf8d89817c4e9f24a1bfb40b598da490.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.34], [2, 0.34, 0.46], [3, 0.46, 0.76], [4, 0.76, 1.04], [5, 1.04, 1.32], [6, 1.32, 1.68], [7, 1.68, 1.82], [8, 1.82, 2.22], [9, 3.02, 3.14], [10, 3.14, 3.36], [11, 3.36, 3.54], [12, 3.54, 3.84], [13, 3.84, 4.1], [14, 4.1, 4.44], [15, 4.44, 4.66], [16, 4.66, 4.84], [17, 4.84, 5.14], [18, 5.14, 5.54], [19, 5.54, 5.74], [20, 5.74, 6.06], [21, 6.06, 6.26], [22, 6.26, 6.36], [23, 6.36, 6.82]]}, {"text": "Many teams loose hours of coding time trying to communicate with a device or API unnecessarily.", "block": 24, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1e11027ac9a14969258413a2887ea253420b160aa942e714f39d7f925e469160.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [1, 0.34, 0.7], [2, 0.7, 0.94], [3, 0.94, 1.34], [4, 1.34, 1.52], [5, 1.52, 1.76], [6, 1.76, 2.12], [7, 2.12, 2.42], [8, 2.42, 2.58], [9, 2.58, 3.04], [10, 3.04, 3.32], [12, 3.44, 3.72], [13, 3.72, 4.04], [14, 4.04, 4.46], [15, 4.46, 5.46]]}, {"text": "The Presentation", "block": 25, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/546030c94fa89829e20b82449b01f9df7d0eed13f67c41aaad22567ec5f5b33e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.12], [1, 0.12, 0.78]]}, {"text": "This is where many teams mess this up.", "block": 26, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/eea582898ab376de6ab6ea08a1110549322b799507c1f205bcc36288581f0afd.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.76], [4, 0.76, 1.18], [5, 1.18, 1.42], [6, 1.42, 1.68], [7, 1.68, 2.04]]}, {"text": "I have seen some really awesome presentations by people that don’t have that impressive of a product and I have seen some terrible presentations by people that could of had a good product.", "block": 26, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a809e6240a372cf52bd3da2c9217d1824a9b6a8c48387c98918acf21a848c474.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.78], [4, 0.78, 1.04], [5, 1.04, 1.4], [6, 1.4, 2.02], [7, 2.02, 2.4], [8, 2.4, 2.66], [9, 2.66, 2.84], [10, 2.84, 3.16], [11, 3.16, 3.32], [12, 3.32, 3.54], [13, 3.54, 3.92], [14, 3.92, 4.1], [15, 4.1, 4.16], [16, 4.16, 4.5], [18, 5.06, 5.22], [19, 5.22, 5.42], [20, 5.42, 5.6], [21, 5.6, 5.84], [22, 5.84, 6.2], [23, 6.2, 6.84], [24, 6.84, 7.22], [25, 7.22, 7.52], [26, 7.52, 7.72], [27, 7.72, 7.94], [29, 8.22, 8.36], [30, 8.36, 8.46], [31, 8.46, 8.6], [32, 8.6, 9.0]]}, {"text": "If you don’t have a presenter, please go learn some basic presentation skills.", "block": 27, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/103ed299bc3773b4ac9ee80c5c12508d7df5042b789d5ee9f5e6320b7f810d73.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 0.72], [4, 0.72, 0.84], [5, 0.84, 1.22], [6, 1.64, 1.78], [7, 1.78, 1.98], [8, 1.98, 2.18], [9, 2.18, 2.44], [10, 2.44, 2.92], [11, 2.92, 3.42], [12, 3.42, 3.94]]}, {"text": "Presentation Tips", "block": 28, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a9b4f170339d6886d1a3c45b7f940d6cb6e49e9d048a2dbf301c30acfa16268e.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.62], [1, 0.62, 0.92]]}, {"text": "Don’t go up there to show off source code.", "block": 29, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7d7f6f0350c5553924f563efc681bd2b31dd908d8bce6645373af08d48d43617.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.3], [2, 0.3, 0.48], [3, 0.48, 0.6], [4, 0.6, 0.8], [5, 0.8, 1.0], [6, 1.0, 1.18], [7, 1.18, 1.44], [8, 1.44, 1.76]]}, {"text": "Focus on what you accomplished, not what you could do if you had the right resources.", "block": 30, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/eadeda0981e5b7b12314f190beafcd557cea84f8529702f8b9f9de9dd837a768.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.68], [3, 0.68, 0.78], [4, 0.78, 1.26], [5, 1.66, 1.82], [6, 1.82, 2.04], [7, 2.04, 2.16], [8, 2.16, 2.3], [9, 2.3, 2.52], [10, 2.52, 2.78], [11, 2.78, 2.88], [12, 2.88, 3.0], [13, 3.0, 3.14], [14, 3.14, 3.3], [15, 3.3, 3.76]]}, {"text": "Test your application over and over before presenting.", "block": 31, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/82a45e54fd6b2b0233df37593e49cf0244117c3a764434432aa5c7ea221398b8.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.22], [1, 0.22, 0.42], [2, 0.42, 0.96], [3, 0.96, 1.28], [4, 1.28, 1.46], [5, 1.46, 1.72], [6, 1.72, 2.0], [7, 2.0, 2.52]]}, {"text": "Don’t let it crash!", "block": 31, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d6769ca3ce99377698f471f05b20d1b0fef4a6aa3fe10ed6e581932eb29e3873.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.52], [3, 0.52, 0.8]]}, {"text": "The basic format should be", "block": 32, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/a1e96b94c4d66fc771adf788c2c2254cbce1b58f7693b28ae2372964db525bc0.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.98], [3, 0.98, 1.36], [4, 1.36, 1.86]]}, {"text": "Introduction of members", "block": 33, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/805ee845685fc873f1a651dd2c5e02c42d94438e431ebe86661e25aa01fe9784.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.62], [1, 0.62, 0.76], [2, 0.76, 1.04]]}, {"text": "Problem you tried to solve", "block": 34, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2eb09fccad9654dde1e96401ecef6263cc304bf4b3b652b444674d18950e3620.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.38], [1, 0.38, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.14]]}, {"text": "How you solved the problem", "block": 35, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/8ad1222d30e0b402aaadc38a75663008e482e1f336f6c75621305cc126a73088.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.2], [1, 0.2, 0.4], [3, 0.64, 0.8], [4, 0.8, 1.16]]}, {"text": "Demonstration of the prototype", "block": 36, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/f5c3c4e77ed31545e9f69a53aff7b5f031b1b729a493e81f89297a801f4c3cef.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.78], [1, 0.78, 1.06], [2, 1.06, 1.2], [3, 1.2, 1.64]]}, {"text": "Be funny.", "block": 37, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/4c046d09ae386d581a6808d1ff051896ec037344aab32e3ceedf14e754c25d56.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.4]]}, {"text": "Start of with a Joke or a “ask the audience” question like “How many of you have this problem?”", "block": 37, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/4f658cee405808e71747ffcd73c89ca52187f9a130abb8b0ddf3df464ee31f7f.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [3, 0.6, 0.8], [4, 0.8, 1.06], [5, 1.06, 1.52], [7, 1.52, 2.14], [8, 2.14, 2.36], [9, 2.36, 2.66], [10, 2.66, 3.14], [11, 3.14, 3.5], [13, 4.44, 4.62], [14, 4.62, 4.8], [15, 4.8, 4.92], [16, 4.92, 5.08], [17, 5.08, 5.28], [18, 5.28, 5.66]]}, {"text": "Closing", "block": 38, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/678372b5f1403b5c6202a8662d0f9b3de907e85175583d3fc9c7501f59d1ef62.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.38]]}, {"text": "Don’t forget to bring business cards!", "block": 39, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/97632be84cb1d0dd16874cbc8fdd3404dd5504757a3c9726cfd7316fbcd84b28.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.28], [1, 0.28, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.66], [3, 0.66, 0.82], [4, 0.82, 1.12], [5, 1.12, 1.5]]}, {"text": "Remember this event should be about the networking and not the prize.", "block": 39, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e477eb445ad1fe056c7305090f9f2c5d460247556f3baf210257d32ad3d70931.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.54], [2, 0.54, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 0.94], [4, 0.94, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.26], [6, 1.26, 1.42], [7, 1.42, 1.74], [8, 1.74, 2.1], [9, 2.1, 2.3], [10, 2.3, 2.46], [11, 2.46, 2.74]]}, {"text": "Be sure to communicate with everyone you talk with what your skillset is and what you are interested in.", "block": 40, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/fb11ad1d42dc483992fa2519b91e5f1d165d884ed281b9738b93b0895acf9fe6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.46], [3, 0.46, 0.88], [4, 0.88, 1.1], [5, 1.1, 1.44], [6, 1.44, 1.62], [7, 1.62, 1.86], [8, 1.86, 2.08], [9, 2.08, 2.26], [10, 2.26, 2.42], [12, 2.86, 3.14], [13, 3.14, 3.66], [14, 3.66, 3.82], [15, 3.82, 3.92], [17, 4.02, 4.44], [18, 4.44, 4.72]]}, {"text": "This will help them understand how you can help them in the future (and how they can help you).", "block": 40, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b90a1334c4e0377229b8e55d466141b121f8ff9649549a7c7dacb2b9a3b81699.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [1, 0.36, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 0.72], [3, 0.72, 0.9], [4, 0.9, 1.4], [5, 1.4, 1.62], [6, 1.62, 1.74], [7, 1.74, 1.88], [8, 1.88, 2.06], [9, 2.06, 2.24], [10, 2.24, 2.34], [11, 2.34, 2.42], [12, 2.42, 2.76], [13, 2.76, 3.16], [14, 3.16, 3.36], [15, 3.36, 3.52], [16, 3.52, 3.72], [17, 3.72, 3.9], [18, 3.9, 4.16]]}]}